l rapids and surf waves at higher flows, along with some brush islands to slalom through. There is a small pull out and path to the water kayakers can use here: 45.05054128361372, -123.50889516122247\n\nPlywood Falls is a ledge drop below Hampton Park in Willamina that can be scouted on the left, more easy floating continues down to Sheridan. There is a small rapid with nice front surf waves shortly upstream of the Mill Creek confluence.\n\nFull description in[Soggy Sneakers](http://www.americanwhitewater.org/library/bgnw/).","averageGradient":"10","maxGradient":null,"length":"12","correlations":[{"reachID":"1571","isPrimary":true,"correlationDetails":{"metric":"cfs","belowRecommendedRangeComment":null,"lowRunnableRangeComment":null,"mediumRunnableRangeComment":null,"highRunnableRangeComment":null,"aboveRecommendedRangeComment":null,"lowRunnableAdjustedDifficulty":null,"highRunnableAdjustedDifficulty":null,"beginLowRunnable":"400","beginMediumRunnable":"700","beginHighRunnable":"3000","endHighRunnable":"4000"},"gaugeInfo":{"name":"South Yamhill River near Willamina","gaugeSource":"NOAA","gaugeSourceIdentifier":"wlao3","gaugeFetchStatus":"ACTIVE","latestFlowReading":{"value":"104","dateTime":"2026-05-12T02:15:00.000Z","qualifier":"NORMAL"},"latestStageReading":{"value":"2.14","dateTime":"2026-05-12T02:15:00.000Z","qualifier":"NORMAL"},"location":{"latitude":"45.047222222222","longitude":"-123.50277777778"},"externalSourceLinks":{"sourceLink":{"url":"https://water.noaa.gov/gauges/wlao3","text":"NOAA Gauge Details"}}},"migrationErrorExplanation":null,"comment":null,"status":{"status":"below-recommended","latestReading":{"value":"104","dateTime":"2026-05-12T02:15:00.000Z","qualifier":"NORMAL"},"metric":"cfs","adjustedDifficulty":null}}],"pointOfInterestIDs":["111745","117017"],"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[-123.57117176,45.0619389],[-123.57117176,45.062791],[-123.5710001,45.06330631],[-123.57082844,45.0635185],[-123.57082844,45.0635185],[-123.57048512,